From 90d6d02ef4f8079c983be08cc7407b36887596fb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dimitry Kloper <dimitry.kloper@intel.com>
Date: Sun, 29 Sep 2024 13:02:36 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Implement minimal emulation of pipe() functionality ...

This change introduces a minimal implementation of pipe() system call.
The returned pair of two file descriptors references a special device
containing a pair of linked circular read buffers. Each write() operation
puts bytes into sibling buffer, and each read() returns bytes from the local
buffer, emulating the pipe() functionality.
